WEBVTT

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:01.096
If a girl comes to your house,

00:10:01.138 --> 00:10:03.599
keep her there until
the family member can come

00:10:03.599 --> 00:10:05.476
because there's a danger in the street.

00:10:05.476 --> 00:10:07.311
So we start the whole thing like that.

00:10:07.353 --> 00:10:10.022
What is going on today

00:10:10.064 --> 00:10:12.232
that I’m really proud of

00:10:12.274 --> 00:10:15.611
is that those young girls

00:10:15.653 --> 00:10:19.114
are becoming entrepreneurs
and creating jobs.

00:10:20.449 --> 00:10:24.203
They are in total control
of what they do with their money.

00:10:24.953 --> 00:10:27.456
They decided they're going to save money.

00:10:27.498 --> 00:10:28.749
It's not me.

00:10:28.791 --> 00:10:31.043
For the children
not to go through this again.